# MODULE Android ARM64 native entry feasibility probe
# PURPOSE emit a small Android shared library with one native return instruction
# INPUT no bytes
# OUTPUT ELF64 shared library exporting the NativeActivity creation callback
# TAPE zero byte printer one multiplication scratch two zero run counter
# ABI callback ignores its three OS arguments and returns without state or I O
# LIMITATION no compiler guest runtime logging app output or COCK native ABI
# LIMITATION target loader and callback execution require independent device tests

